          "url": "https://talk.nervos.org/t/questions-about-ckba/10471/29",
          "content_text": "matt_ckb:\nJust an fyi, conversations are better handled through chat platforms like Telegram or Discord, while the Forum is better for long form text\nI’m in the Telegram groups, but messages there are easy to miss and get buried. I’d rather keep governance questions here, where the answers are public and easy to reference later.\nmatt_ckb:\ncontractors funded by the association\nSince these teams are contractors funded by CKBA, who is responsible for turning those three priorities into actual budgets, milestones, and deliverables—the Operations Director or the Board?",
          "content_html": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"matt_ckb\" data-post=\"28\" data-topic=\"10471\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/matt_ckb/48/6296_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> matt_ckb:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just an fyi, conversations are better handled through chat platforms like Telegram or Discord, while the Forum is better for long form text</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I’m in the Telegram groups, but messages there are easy to miss and get buried. I’d rather keep governance questions here, where the answers are public and easy to reference later.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"matt_ckb\" data-post=\"28\" data-topic=\"10471\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/matt_ckb/48/6296_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> matt_ckb:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>contractors funded by the association</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Since these teams are contractors funded by CKBA, who is responsible for turning those three priorities into actual budgets, milestones, and deliverables—the Operations Director or the Board?</p>",
